# Google hands you this when you create an OAuth client. It holds a real
# client_secret, which this app never uses and must never publish — the browser
# flow is PKCE-based and has nowhere to keep one. Keep the file out of the
# repository entirely; the only value needed from it is the client id, which
# lives in src/config.js.
client_secret*.json
